## 1.1 Platform Analysis

✅ **Linux Platform Supported**: This MCP server CAN be deployed on Linux. The README explicitly mentions Linux paths for configuration files and provides instructions for running on Linux using `uv` and Docker.

## 1.2 Deployment Options Extracted

Based on the README, I identified the following deployment options:

| Option | Type | Description | Status |
|--------|------|-------------|--------|
| **Hosted Endpoint** | Remote Deployment | Use the public hosted endpoint at `https://mcp.data.gouv.fr/mcp` | ✅ Available |
| **Docker** | Local Deployment | Clone repo and run with `docker compose up -d` | ❌ [PROHIBITED] |
| **Manual Installation** | Local Deployment | Clone repo, install with `uv sync`, run with `uv run main.py` | ✅ Available |

**Notes:**
- No free-installation deployment (npx/uvx) is available for this server
