      ],
      "env": {
        "BACKEND_TYPE": "jaeger",
        "BACKEND_URL": "http://localhost:16686"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

</details>

</details>

**_Prerequisites:_**

- Python 3.11 or higher
- [pipx](https://pipx.pypa.io/) or [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) installed

